{"title":"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Third Round","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The third round of the <b>54th <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Polish Mathematical Olympiad\">Polish Mathematical Olympiad</a></b> was held on April 14 and 15, 2003.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems (page does not exist)\">2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems/Problem 3\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Polish_Mathematical_Olympiad_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2003 Polish Mathematical Olympiad Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 6</a></li></ul>\n<h2><sp